# Project: vyrel
# Ecosystem: TypeScript

Monorepo context for Cursor. Full stack map, commands, and conventions live in
[`AGENTS.md`](./AGENTS.md) — keep that file updated when the repo changes.

## Stack (current)

- Runtime / PM: bun
- Web: Next.js App Router + Tailwind + shadcn (`@vyrel/shared`)
- Mobile: Expo ~57 + Expo Router + HeroUI Native (`apps/mobile`)
- API: Elysia + graphql-yoga + Pothos
- Data: SQLite/libSQL + Drizzle; Zod validation; Effect on server domain
- GraphQL clients: gql.tada + Apollo + `@vyrel/graphql-client`
- Bridge: `@vyrel/morph` (Zod → Pothos)
- Auth: better-auth organizations (+ `@better-auth/expo` on mobile)
- Env: `@vyrel/env` · Logging: `@vyrel/logging` (evlog) · Jobs: BullMQ · Email: Resend
- Lint/format: Ultracite (Biome)
- Tests: Vitest / Playwright; mobile Jest + Maestro

## Conventions

- Follow existing code patterns and package boundaries (`@vyrel/*` workspace scope).
- Client state: React state, feature context, Apollo cache, `authClient` — **no Zustand** unless asked.
- New server model → `.agents/skills/add-model-server/SKILL.md`
- New web feature → `.agents/skills/add-model-client/SKILL.md`
- Do not run db migrate/push or GraphQL codegen unless the user asks.
- HeroUI Native: search `.heroui-docs/native` / MCP; memory of the library is unreliable.